# Chinese translations for token_repeat_pattern.md
msgid ""
msgstr ""
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
"Language: zh_CN\n"

msgid "# Token repetition detection (pattern backend)"
msgstr "# Token 重复检测（pattern 后端）"

msgid ""
"`token_repeat` uses a fixed pattern-based rule set with 64 raw-token check\n"
"boundaries and a final partial-block flush. There is no sliding-window\n"
"algorithm and no `algorithm` selector. The native CPU extension ships with\n"
"vllm-ascend (`native_pattern`); no separate install step is required."
msgstr "`token_repeat` 使用固定的基于 pattern 的规则集，在 64 个原始 token 检查边界处判定，并在末尾做部分块 flush。不再提供滑动窗口算法，也没有 `algorithm` 选择器。原生 CPU 扩展随 vllm-ascend（`native_pattern`）一并提供，无需单独安装。"

msgid ""
"Alert thresholds, short on-call titles, and long rule ids live in packaged\n"
"`native_pattern/pattern.json` (loaded once at detector init; not a\n"
"`runtime_config` hot-reload field). Feature share windows and the feature-rule\n"
"list are also JSON-driven."
msgstr "告警阈值、短 on-call title 与长 rule id 在打包的 `native_pattern/pattern.json` 中（检测器初始化时加载一次；不是 `runtime_config` 热更新字段）。特征窗与 feature_rules 列表也由 JSON 驱动。"

msgid ""
"**Breaking change:** former sliding-window keys (`window`,\n"
"`repeat_sum_threshold`, `min_tokens`, `consecutive_hits`, `ignore_token_ids`,\n"
"`algorithm`) are rejected as unknown. Migrate to:"
msgstr "**破坏性变更：** 原滑动窗口相关键（`window`、`repeat_sum_threshold`、`min_tokens`、`consecutive_hits`、`ignore_token_ids`、`algorithm`）会作为未知键被拒绝。请迁移为："

msgid ""
"Use `-1` for chat mode, or the model's explicit `</think>` token ID for reasoning.\n"
"Tables are built from the served model's `tokenizer.json` during enable-time\n"
"warmup. ByteLevel BPE is supported; remote model IDs require tokenizer.json in\n"
"the local HF cache. The table stays in memory and is released when the detector\n"
"is disabled. Warmup logs vocabulary size and elapsed time, with a warning above\n"
"the 5-second target."
msgstr "chat 模式使用 `-1`；推理场景使用模型显式的 `</think>` token ID。启用时预热阶段从所服务模型的 `tokenizer.json` 构建表。支持 ByteLevel BPE；远程模型 ID 需要本地 HF 缓存中有 tokenizer.json。表常驻内存，检测器禁用时释放。预热会记录词表大小与耗时，超过 5 秒目标会告警。"

msgid ""
"Warmup failure is logged once for that enable attempt and leaves detection\n"
"unavailable; inference can continue. Fix the tokenizer/resources and\n"
"disable/re-enable to retry. Rebinding to a different model rebuilds the tables."
msgstr "某次启用若预热失败只会记一次日志，检测不可用，但推理可继续。修好 tokenizer/资源后，通过禁用再启用以重试。换绑到不同模型会重建表。"

msgid ""
"Detection uses the existing CPU ActionQueue and Incident actions. If the queue\n"
"is full or stopping, that step's detect job may be dropped (warning logged)."
msgstr "检测复用现有 CPU ActionQueue 与 Incident 动作。若队列已满或正在停止，该步的检测任务可能被丢弃（会打 warning 日志）。"

msgid ""
"Terminal tails are checked before Store cleanup after CPU jobs drain. Forced\n"
"cleanup at the deferred-wave limit can skip the terminal check for outstanding\n"
"jobs; this is explicitly logged."
msgstr "CPU 任务排空后、Store 清理前会检查终端尾巴。在延迟波次上限强制清理时，可能跳过未完成任务的终端检查；该情况会显式打日志。"

msgid ""
"Incident `detail` carries a short on-call `reason` (JSON `title`) and a long\n"
"`rule` id (JSON `reason`), in native evaluation order:"
msgstr "Incident `detail` 带短 on-call `reason`（JSON `title`）与长 `rule` id（JSON `reason`），按原生求值顺序："

msgid "| reason (title) | rule (long id) | meaning (short) |"
msgstr "| reason（title） | rule（长 id） | 含义（简） |"

msgid "| `exact_x5` / `exact_x3` | `vllm[32,500]x5` / `vllm[32,2000]x3` | exact raw-token period copies |"
msgstr "| `exact_x5` / `exact_x3` | `vllm[32,500]x5` / `vllm[32,2000]x3` | 原始 token 周期精确拷贝 |"

msgid "| `run_char` | `run>=500` | long same-char run |"
msgstr "| `run_char` | `run>=500` | 超长同字符 run |"

msgid "| `a3_dense` / `a5_*` / `p_n8` | `A3_*` / `A5_*` / `P_*` | n-gram density features |"
msgstr "| `a3_dense` / `a5_*` / `p_n8` | `A3_*` / `A5_*` / `P_*` | n-gram 密度特征 |"

msgid "| `wrep_*` | `wrep_*` | word-repeat share |"
msgstr "| `wrep_*` | `wrep_*` | 词重复占比 |"

msgid "| `sdup_*` | `sdup_*` | sentence-duplicate share |"
msgstr "| `sdup_*` | `sdup_*` | 句子重复占比 |"

msgid ""
"Focused regression tests are in `tests/ut/runtime_guard/test_token_repeat_pattern.py`.\n"
"Native cases and Python-gold parity require a compiled install and skip when the\n"
"extension is absent."
msgstr "专项回归测试见 `tests/ut/runtime_guard/test_token_repeat_pattern.py`。原生用例与 Python 金标对照需要已编译安装；扩展缺失时 skip。"
